{"seq":1,"slug":"universal-approximation-theorem","title":"通用逼近定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematics-of-deep-learning/dl-theory/universal-approximation-theorem","wordCount":2248,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"通用逼近定理\">通用逼近定理</h1><p>神经网络为什么「能」学习任何函数？通用逼近定理（Universal Approximation Theorem）给出了理论保证：一个足够宽的单隐层前馈网络，在温和条件下，可以任意精度逼近紧集上的任何连续函数。但「原则上可以」和「实际中能学到」之间有巨大鸿沟——定理不保证梯度下降能找到正确的参数，也不告诉你需要多宽的网络。理解这个定理的边界和局限，你才能对神经网络的表达能力有一个清醒的认知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>通用逼近定理的经典表述（Hornik, Stinchcombe &amp; White, 1989）：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个连续的、非常值的激活函数（如 sigmoid、tanh、ReLU）。对于任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 和任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\subset \\mathbb{R}^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上的连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: K \\to \\mathbb{R}^m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，存在一个单隐层前馈网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i \\sigma(a_i^T x + b_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|f(x) - g(x)\\| &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Input[&quot;输入 x ∈ R^d&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;× a_i + b_i&quot;| Pre[&quot;预激活 z_i = a_i^T x + b_i&quot;]&#10;    Pre --&gt;|&quot;σ&quot;| Act[&quot;激活 σ(z_i)&quot;]&#10;    Act --&gt;|&quot;× w_i + 求和&quot;| Output[&quot;输出 g(x) = Σ w_i σ(a_i^T x + b_i)&quot;]&#10;    Output --&gt;|&quot;逼近&quot;| Target[&quot;目标 f(x)&lt;br/&gt;任意连续函数&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Input[\"输入 x ∈ R^d\"] --&gt;|\"× a_i + b_i\"| Pre[\"预激活 z_i = a_i^T x + b_i\"]\n    Pre --&gt;|\"σ\"| Act[\"激活 σ(z_i)\"]\n    Act --&gt;|\"× w_i + 求和\"| Output[\"输出 g(x) = Σ w_i σ(a_i^T x + b_i)\"]\n    Output --&gt;|\"逼近\"| Target[\"目标 f(x)&lt;br/&gt;任意连续函数\"]</pre><p>这个定理的惊人之处在于：<strong>一个隐层就够了</strong>。无论目标函数多么复杂，只要它是连续的、定义在紧集上，一个足够宽的单隐层网络就能逼近它。</p>\n<p>但「足够宽」可能意味着非常宽。定理是存在性的——它保证存在这样的网络，但不告诉你 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（隐层宽度）需要多大。对于某些「难逼近」的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 可能需要指数级大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度的指数优势\">深度的指数优势</h2><p>单隐层网络原则上能逼近任何函数，但<strong>深度网络能用指数级更少的参数达到同样的逼近精度</strong>。这就是深度的指数优势（exponential expressivity）。</p>\n<p>一个经典的结果（Telgarsky, 2016; Eldan &amp; Shamir, 2016）表明：存在一类函数，深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的网络可以用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 参数高效表示，但任何深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的网络需要指数级多的参数才能逼近。</p>\n<p>直觉上，深度网络的每一层都在做一个「特征变换」——将输入空间的区域重新排列、折叠、组合。浅层网络必须在「一步」内完成所有变换，而深度网络可以分步完成，每步只做一个相对简单的变换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络深度</th>\n<th>表达能力</th>\n<th>参数效率</th>\n<th>训练难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单隐层（浅）</td>\n<td>原则上任意</td>\n<td>低（某些函数需指数参数）</td>\n<td>易（凸优化友好）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-3 隐层</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深（数十到数千层）</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>高（指数效率）</td>\n<td>难（需归一化、残差等）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 浅层网络&#10;        X1[&quot;x&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;一步变换&quot;| Y1[&quot;f(x)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 深层网络&#10;        X2[&quot;x&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;变换1&quot;| H1[&quot;h₁&quot;]&#10;        H1 --&gt;|&quot;变换2&quot;| H2[&quot;h₂&quot;]&#10;        H2 --&gt;|&quot;变换3&quot;| H3[&quot;h₃&quot;]&#10;        H3 --&gt;|&quot;变换n&quot;| Y2[&quot;f(x)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 浅层网络\n        X1[\"x\"] --&gt;|\"一步变换\"| Y1[\"f(x)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 深层网络\n        X2[\"x\"] --&gt;|\"变换1\"| H1[\"h₁\"]\n        H1 --&gt;|\"变换2\"| H2[\"h₂\"]\n        H2 --&gt;|\"变换3\"| H3[\"h₃\"]\n        H3 --&gt;|\"变换n\"| Y2[\"f(x)\"]\n    end</pre><p>深度的优势在实践中随处可见：ImageNet 上的性能从 AlexNet（8 层）到 VGG（19 层）到 ResNet（152 层）持续提升，Transformer 的性能随深度增加而改善（尽管收益在某个点后递减）。但深度也带来了训练困难——梯度消失/爆炸、优化不稳定、过参数化等问题，需要 BatchNorm、残差连接、学习率预热等工程技巧来缓解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不同架构的逼近能力\">不同架构的逼近能力</h2><p>通用逼近定理最初是为前馈网络证明的，但类似结果也被扩展到了其他架构：</p>\n<p><strong>卷积神经网络（CNN）</strong>：CNN 的参数共享和局部感受野限制了它的表达能力——对于某些需要全局交互的函数，CNN 需要比全连接网络更宽。但对于具有<strong>局部性和平移等变性</strong>的函数（如图像处理），CNN 远比对等宽度的全连接网络更高效。卷积的通用逼近性质在适当条件下成立（如滤波器大小随网络增长）。</p>\n<p><strong>循环神经网络（RNN）</strong>：RNN 是图灵完备的——在理论上可以模拟任何算法（给定足够的隐藏单元和时间步）。但这是一个比通用逼近更强的保证：不仅能逼近任何函数，还能实现任何可计算过程。实践中，LSTM 和 GRU 通过门控机制缓解了长序列训练中的梯度消失问题。</p>\n<p><strong>Transformer / 自注意力</strong>：自注意力架构的表达能力是近年来研究的热点。已证明，在适当条件下，Transformer 能逼近任何序列到序列的连续函数。注意力机制的全局交互能力（每个 token 直接关注所有其他 token）使得 Transformer 在需要长距离依赖的任务上比 RNN 和 CNN 更高效。但 Transformer 的表达能力也带来了过参数化的风险——大模型可能「记住」训练数据而非泛化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>通用逼近保证</th>\n<th>表达效率</th>\n<th>擅长的函数类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全连接前馈</td>\n<td>✅ 经典结果</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>任意连续函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CNN</td>\n<td>✅（适当条件下）</td>\n<td>高（局部/平移等变）</td>\n<td>图像、空间局部交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RNN/LSTM</td>\n<td>✅ 图灵完备</td>\n<td>高（顺序/递归）</td>\n<td>序列、时间依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>✅（近年证明）</td>\n<td>高（全局交互）</td>\n<td>长距离依赖、结构化序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GNN</td>\n<td>✅（适当条件下）</td>\n<td>高（置换等变）</td>\n<td>图结构数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定理的实际边界\">定理的实际边界</h2><p>通用逼近定理有几个重要的「但是」，理解这些边界比记住定理本身更重要：</p>\n<p><strong>「紧集」限制</strong>。定理保证的是在紧集（有界闭集）上的逼近。对于超出训练分布范围的输入（OOD，out-of-distribution），网络的行为没有任何保证——它可能输出完全荒谬的结果。这就是为什么对抗样本存在：对输入做一个微小的、人类不可察觉的扰动，就可能将它推出训练分布的紧集，导致网络给出错误的预测。</p>\n<p><strong>「存在」≠「可学习」</strong>。定理保证存在一个好的网络参数，但不保证梯度下降能找到它。在非凸损失曲面上，梯度下降可能收敛到一个远非最优的局部解。幸运的是，实践中对于宽网络和过参数化网络，梯度下降通常能找到一个「足够好」的解——这与<a href=\"generalization-theory\">泛化理论</a>中的「过参数化网络的泛化之谜」直接相关。</p>\n<p><strong>「连续」限制</strong>。定理只保证对连续函数的逼近。对于不连续的目标函数（如某些组合优化问题的目标），神经网络可能需要非常多的神经元来逼近不连续点附近的「跳变」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;通用逼近定理保证&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;紧集上的连续函数&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;存在足够宽的单隐层网络&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;任意精度 ε &gt; 0&quot;]&#10;    E[&quot;定理不保证&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;OOD 输入上的行为&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;梯度下降能找到好参数&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;不连续函数的高效逼近&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;网络宽度 N 的具体上界&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"通用逼近定理保证\"] --&gt; B[\"紧集上的连续函数\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"存在足够宽的单隐层网络\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"任意精度 ε &gt; 0\"]\n    E[\"定理不保证\"] --&gt; F[\"OOD 输入上的行为\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"梯度下降能找到好参数\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"不连续函数的高效逼近\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"网络宽度 N 的具体上界\"]</pre><h2 id=\"定量逼近界\">定量逼近界</h2><p>经典通用逼近定理是定性的——「存在一个网络」。但我们更关心定量的问题：<strong>要达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 精度，需要多少个神经元？</strong></p>\n<p>对于单隐层网络，Barron（1993）给出了一个经典结果：如果目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的傅里叶变换满足一定的衰减条件（一阶矩有限），则存在一个宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的单隐层网络，使得逼近误差为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim \\mu}\\|f(x) - g(x)\\|^2 \\leq \\frac{C_f}{\\sqrt{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2903em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是输入分布。这意味着要将误差减半，需要 4 倍的神经元。</p>\n<p>对于深度网络，定量结果更复杂，但一般来说深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的网络可以用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>poly</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L \\cdot \\text{poly}(1/\\epsilon))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">poly</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 参数达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 精度，而浅层网络可能需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\exp(1/\\epsilon))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 参数——深度的指数优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结果</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>宽度/深度需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hornik 1989</td>\n<td>连续函数，单隐层</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>（存在性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Barron 1993</td>\n<td>傅里叶一阶矩有限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = O(1/\\epsilon^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Telgarsky 2016</td>\n<td>特定「难」函数类</td>\n<td>深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 可表示，浅层需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近年结果</td>\n<td>ReLU 网络</td>\n<td>深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的网络可表示的函数类随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 指数增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些定量结果告诉我们：对于「简单」函数（傅里叶变换快速衰减），适度宽度的网络就够了；对于「复杂」函数，深度网络的参数效率优势显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>通用逼近定理为神经网络的表达能力提供了理论基础。</p>\n<p>要点回顾：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一个隐层原则上够了</strong>：足够宽的单隐层网络能逼近紧集上任何连续函数</li>\n<li><strong>但深度有指数优势</strong>：深度网络能用指数级更少的参数达到同样精度，这是为什么我们用深度网络</li>\n<li><strong>不同架构各有所长</strong>：CNN 擅长局部/平移等变，RNN 擅长序列，Transformer 擅长全局交互</li>\n<li><strong>「存在」≠「可学习」</strong>：定理保证存在好参数，但不保证梯度下降能找到</li>\n<li><strong>紧集外无保证</strong>：OOD 输入上网络行为不可预测——这是对抗样本的理论根源</li>\n<li><strong>定量界告诉我们需要多少神经元</strong>：Barron 界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\epsilon^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，深度网络更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇<a href=\"generalization-theory\">泛化理论</a>将探讨一个更实际的问题：为什么参数比训练数据还多的网络反而能泛化得这么好？传统统计学习理论无法解释这个现象，而现代泛化理论（双重下降、隐式正则化、平坦极小值）正在提供新的视角。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通用逼近定理","id":"通用逼近定理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深度的指数优势","id":"深度的指数优势"},{"level":2,"text":"不同架构的逼近能力","id":"不同架构的逼近能力"},{"level":2,"text":"定理的实际边界","id":"定理的实际边界"},{"level":2,"text":"定量逼近界","id":"定量逼近界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信息论与损失函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematics-of-deep-learning/probability-statistics/information-theory"},"next":{"title":"泛化理论与正则化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematics-of-deep-learning/dl-theory/generalization-theory"}}